{"availability":"available","full":"Medialoco/ventoux-watch","name":"ventoux-watch","description":"A Raspberry Pi 5 somewhere in Los Angeles watches the Mont Serein pass (1,389 m, Mont Ventoux), one frame a second. OpenCV finds motion, YOLO names it, the Pi rebuilds the picture. Cannes is the backup camera. Free Dogmazic music, #FREETECHNORADIO, live on YouTube.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-25T03:49:54Z","updated":"2026-10-12T18:52:08Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://medialoco.github.io/ventoux-watch/","topics":["computer-vision","creative-commons","dogmazic","freetechnoradio","mont-serein","mont-ventoux","opencv","programmez","raspberry-pi","slow-tv","vaucluse","webcam","yolo","youtube"],"demo":"https://medialoco.github.io/ventoux-watch/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.345Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.345Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.345Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:04.807Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.345Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Un Raspberry Pi 5, sur un bureau à Los Angeles, regarde la webcam du col du Mont Serein, à 1 389 m sur le mont Ventoux. Une image par seconde. OpenCV trouve ce qui a bougé, YOLO nomme la découpe, et le Pi reconstruit le cadre : la photographie, le rectangle, les encarts, la musique. La veille est le travail. Le flux est le spectacle.","Trois modes, et chaque caméra est le relais de l’autre.","Le Mont Serein. La playlist est ouverte, le cadre est le col. Cannes attend."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Medialoco/ventoux-watch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"875a3b61ab9e3fba67bf00a6fdb6b3840ca5ce1ac4ef9df4de3612289cd797ea","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.465Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:47.465Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Un Raspberry Pi 5, sur u